# Messages' feel: the reference that feel-chat.walk is read against, on the app's own example conversations. Frame
# timings report and never hold anything.
fold folded
rotate portrait
shell pm clear dev.omalauncher.messages
launch dev.omalauncher.messages/.MainActivity
tap Look around with example conversations
wait 1000
frames start dev.omalauncher.messages
frames tap open-chat Tahoe trip
expect cabin or hotel
frames start dev.omalauncher.messages
swipe 0.5 0.35 0.5 0.75 200
swipe 0.5 0.35 0.5 0.75 200
swipe 0.5 0.75 0.5 0.35 200
swipe 0.5 0.75 0.5 0.35 200
wait 800
frames report scroll
shot after-scroll
frames start dev.omalauncher.messages
swipe 0.3 0.5 0.95 0.5 250
wait 800
frames report slide-back
shot back-at-inbox
frames tap open-again Mina Park
expect should I bring the sake
frames tap back-button Back to conversations
frames tap open-third Mina Park
tap iMessage | Message
type a line to send
frames start dev.omalauncher.messages
frames tap send Send
wait 800
frames report send
shot sent
